Salon Central LD2410 controller

Pin wiring:
- D2 (GPIO4): relay output
- D6 (GPIO12): LD2410 presence input
- D1 (GPIO5): latching wall-switch input
- GPIO0: reset input
- GPIO13: built-in LED

The presence and wall-switch inputs use the ESP8266 internal pull-up. Presence
is only reported to IotCloud; it does not directly control the relay. Connect
the wall switch between D1 and GND. Either stable edge of the latching switch
toggles the relay.
